  <!-- The hero background is the LCP element (measured: SECTION.hero /
       school3.webp at ~1.0s on mobile). It is a CSS background inside
       image-set(), so nothing discovers it until the stylesheet has
       parsed - PageSpeed reports that as "LCP lazy discovery". Preloading
       it starts the fetch with the HTML instead.
       The logo is NOT the LCP and no longer takes fetchpriority="high"
       away from the image that is; at 12.8KB and present in the markup
       immediately, it does not need a preload of its own. -->
  
  
